nch-actions --test branch-actions virtual_branches::oplog` and expect all restore tests to pass.\\n+\\n+### Task 6: Integration cleanup and validation\\n+\\n+**Files:**\\n+- Modify: all files above only as required by compiler-guided cleanup\\n+- Test: affected crate targets\\n+\\n+- [ ] Run `cargo fmt --all` and inspect that formatting touched only intended Rust files.\\n+- [ ] Run `cargo check -p but-core -p but-ctx -p but-meta -p gitbutler-oplog -p gitbutler-stack -p but-workspace -p but-api -p gitbutler-branch-actions --all-targets`.\\n+- [ ] Run the targeted tests from Tasks 1 through 5.\\n+- [ ] Run `git diff --check`.\\n+- [ ] Search for remaining production `default_target`, `set_default_target`, `resync_project_meta_from_legacy`, and ProjectMeta-to-workspace mirror writes; every remaining occurrence must be branch-target support, historical decoding, or test fixtures.\\n+- [ ] Review the final diff for a single live authority, no new dependency, no schema migration, no snapshot version bump, and no unrelated generated-code churn.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));","source_record":{"timestamp":"2026-07-12T13:33:02.105Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"[REDACTED:entropy]","status":"completed","call_id":"[REDACTED:entropy]","name":"exec","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"[REDACTED:entropy]"}}}}